# Task 2 — Formalize Constraints

## Railway Level-Crossing Control System (ARLCCS)

### Symbols

| Symbol | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `Train_Present` | A train is present at the crossing. |
| `Train_Approaching` | A train is approaching the crossing. |
| `Barrier_Open` | The road barrier is open. |
| `Barrier_Closed` | The road barrier is closed. |
| `Warning_Active` | Warning lights and audible alarm are active. |
| `Train_Cleared` | The system has confirmed that the train has completely cleared the crossing. |
| `Sensor_Failure` | A train-detection sensor has failed. |
| `Sensor_Valid` | Sensor readings are valid and consistent. |
| `Emergency` | A critical emergency condition exists. |
| `Communication_Lost` | Communication with the control center is lost. |
| `Barrier_Failure` | The barrier has failed to perform its commanded operation. |
| `Safe` | The crossing is confirmed safe for road traffic. |

